sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor P as Parent or learner
  participant F as Site form (site.js)
  participant W as WhatsApp
  participant G as Apps Script web app
  participant S as Google Sheet and email
  actor K as GeniusEdge (you)
  P->>F: Fills the form and presses the button
  F->>F: Checks fields, consent, grade fits programme
  F->>W: Opens wa.me with a pre-filled message and Ref
  F-)G: POST lead as JSON (same Ref, no waiting)
  G->>G: Validates key, consent, offer, lengths
  G->>S: Appends a row and emails you
  P->>W: Presses send (optional for the sheet)
  W->>K: Message arrives with the same Ref
  K->>P: Replies on WhatsApp, row status updated by hand
